msgid ""
"**注**：收益率、K 线指标、`where` 掩码、组合粗验、完整回测等见 [使用 HistoryPanel "
"操作和分析历史数据](2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md)；完整回测交给 `Operator` / "
"`Backtester`，迁移路径见 [从 HistoryPanel 研究到 Strategy / "
"Operator](2.5-historypanel-data-analysis.md#从-historypanel-研究到-strategy--"
"operator迁移路径)。"
